%% Data-flow sequence for planned order path (Week 1 documents; Week 2 implements)

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Member as Simulated Member
  participant Gateway as Gateway edge-net
  participant Identity as Identity app-net
  participant Matching as Matching Engine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL data-net
  participant Alerting as Alerting security-net

  Member->>Gateway: Submit synthetic order HTTP
  Gateway->>Gateway: Emit JSON log + correlation_id
  Gateway->>Identity: Validate principal / role Week 2+
  Identity-->>Gateway: Allow / deny
  alt authorized
    Gateway->>Matching: Forward order app-net
    Matching->>DB: Persist data-net
    DB-->>Matching: ACK
    Matching-->>Gateway: Accept
    Gateway-->>Member: 2xx
  else denied
    Gateway-->>Member: 401 / 403
  end
  Gateway-->>Alerting: Telemetry / future detections Week 3+
